{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/src/run.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T16:57:07.181686Z","id":"96939966671b895afc45c8a6fe2620fe5d5f1fc0d765f2cf5914663fe2946b58","body":{"detail":"Tick::affordable prices the request as its JSON bytes / 4 tokens, the part the last turn cached at the cached-input rate and the rest at the input rate, then caps max_tokens to the output the credits left pay for. A request whose tokens run well above bytes/4 (non-Latin text, dense JSON) can still overshoot the person's credits by its input; counting tokens (the Messages API count_tokens endpoint) would bound it.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":1509},"end":{"line":1571},"content_hash":"3781cdb210a7ba32e5a8ac60c65d9dfe4dacfc04a1dde81315f0c11e3f1c2faa"},"summary":"A turn's affordable max_tokens rests on a byte-count estimate of its input","supersedes":"f3e678d951897ce53a7a223cfe4b171b96653bca2d09349b3a13f8eb3d49ac44","tags":["credits","session:claude-code:7580ce1b-abf0-421d-8a2a-2be245f95865"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/src/events.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:31:14.240182Z","id":"bd8ad8c2a93dffe970895ab93ec6a717ed5bb5f9032a62450e759f209ab54666","body":{"detail":"Live step_done events carry the step's charge from Store::commit_step; the canonical events rebuilt from committed steps read payload.credits_milli, which the payload never has (the charge is computed at commit), so a client that reconnects sees credits only in run_credits_milli. The store could return the step's charge with the steps (a sum of its usage rows) for the replay.\nRe-anchored unchanged from mailto:alex@kesling.co (session:claude-code:7580ce1b-abf0-421d-8a2a-2be245f95865)'s record.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":355},"end":{"line":363},"content_hash":"6ef3cc4175985ad706c0e6a44514f28225e8ecc43f5d42817c1458c0476a6025"},"summary":"A replayed step_done carries no credits for its step","supersedes":"b31ddcab70856e03c45a23685389874c5e7d4a5e4103a27abd7d20451e7e8c48","tags":["events","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/src/run.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:31:14.332329Z","id":"726e889d436382beea2a46b2cab6252de27721d19ee75d36877d43bd328dd373","body":{"detail":"Spec section 8: locally a value in config.toml or the environment overrides the stored one. from_store reads Store::bot_setting and leaves per_person_concurrency, lease and renewal at their defaults; the daemon's SettingsSource must apply HomeConfig::bot (including bot.per_person_concurrency and enabled) on top, re-read per tick.\nRe-anchored unchanged from mailto:alex@kesling.co (session:claude-code:7580ce1b-abf0-421d-8a2a-2be245f95865)'s record.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":145},"end":{"line":149},"content_hash":"26d90fcdfbcd7a1130c94a90470682b5ff5383da70d7c0c4dc1fe2dfb535d677"},"summary":"RunSettings::from_store reads the database only: the [bot] config overrides are the server's to lay over it","supersedes":"2f8fe43884439c9cdf088a0b2833daf86063a175ea849b59028bdd54b2d0f121","tags":["wiring","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-bot/src/run.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T18:31:14.427710Z","id":"9f41af3ed92302e4e8c594bd1e8a8e8650f091ff2ee289046da4617d53c6414c","body":{"detail":"tick reads run_with_steps and History::of parses each payload (assistant blocks, script code and outcome, the first turn's system prompt) to rebuild the messages, so a run of N steps does O(N) work and reads O(total payload) per tick, O(N^2) over the run. Bounded by max_steps (40 by default); a cache of the history keyed by the last committed step would make it O(1).\nRe-anchored unchanged from mailto:alex@kesling.co (session:claude-code:7580ce1b-abf0-421d-8a2a-2be245f95865)'s record.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":558},"end":{"line":566},"content_hash":"1e7c494d01b9bd2670be02ff48ec4d5300171eb6e49f41c1f8ce2087181447ff"},"summary":"Every tick rebuilds the whole history from every committed step's payload","supersedes":"94a4332dfadbffa08734d4af6baa02ff2581fe215614029decbb419df7b45503","tags":["perf","session:claude-code:985c579c-9fcb-4f5b-b70f-deedb4f3ea58"]}}
